674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_oct6P16I8Q7kNvwEFWuct&_nc_oc=Ado8t7JvjLyuVOSLR_q4jcGtr-mWQemo9cesINttvIKE-ohESEZDj9IY7SuiaAVXU7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDAjEx4tciZk1wI01Gjz06hWnLAnbPSr37w31CenxgexA&oe=6A661A59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4NhqVIOtAH4Q7kNvwFV31Jp&_nc_oc=AdqRmvxaPchoSdG9PuVixZuEMLYDmzyTFKLbb9UfuH3V4rThoB9EWYTpLVmp41DrgX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDwSv_m-rd72fDd8KeTacN3WEkgp0PzpK4NyR4yi3lvZg&oe=6A662316"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ziYU5ccbukYQ7kNvwHQnXWQ&_nc_oc=AdrKmBV-rcQ4qEqvo8rU66Jtod0LtfBwtuo-p8POQycAwAJD0aaLA9xKgKUo2e7vdvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA3DIF4BMY9iuEsqxUEmKXDpvr_lSJLrfLRCsPZp6MJ0g&oe=6A661F31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip